  "description": "JSON API panels: gauges on per-city datasources (GET, empty urlPath, one JSONPath field, a fake appid in jsonData.queryParams), and on one base-URL datasource a query variable (text and value fields), a urlPath with a variable, params with macros, groupBy/metric fields, an epoch-seconds time field and a missing document.",
